  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Hàm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hàm nghịch biến trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nghịch biến trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>max</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>min</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> có tập xác định <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>4</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>max</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>min</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
